# Aitra: paths Semgrep skips (patch "Semgrep", see aitra/README.md).
# Third-party and generated code, and test fixtures that use eval/innerHTML
# on purpose. Writing this file replaces Semgrep's built-in defaults, so the
# usual ones are repeated here.
:include .gitignore

deps/
_build/
node_modules/
assets/vendor/
priv/static/
priv/gettext/
cover/

test/
assets/js/__tests__/
assets/**/*.test.js

*.min.js
*.svg
*.po
*.pot
